<section id="privacy-policy-en" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-sm mb-10">Last updated: September 25, 2026</p>

  <%!-- 1 --%>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">1. Data Controller</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-2">
      The teachercoop website is published by Emmanuel Guefif.
    </p>
    <p class="leading-relaxed">
      For any question regarding your personal data: <a
        href="mailto:contact@teachercoop.org"
        class="underline"
      >contact@teachercoop.org</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- 2 --%>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">2. Data We Collect</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-2">We only collect:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mb-2">
      <li>your email address, provided when you sign up;</li>
      <li>
        technical connection data: IP address, date and time of connection. This data is recorded
        in technical logs for monitoring purposes and to keep the site running properly: detecting
        errors and incidents, tracking performance, and preventing fraudulent access and attacks.
        It is not used to track you or build a profile.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="leading-relaxed">No other personal data is requested.</p>
  </div>

  <%!-- 3 --%>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-2">Your email address is used exclusively to:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mb-4">
      <li>create your account;</li>
      <li>let you log in (by sending login links or codes);</li>
      <li>confirm your registration and secure your account.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
      This processing is based on the performance of the contract between us when you create an account. Technical connection data (logs) is processed for monitoring, security, and the proper operation of the service (legitimate interest), and to comply with our legal obligations.
    </p>
    <p class="leading-relaxed font-medium">
      We never send commercial or advertising emails, or newsletters. Your data is never sold, rented,
      or transferred to third parties.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- 4 --%>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">4. Recipients</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-2">
      Your data is processed solely by Emmanuel Guefif. It is shared with the following technical
      service providers, only to the extent necessary for their services:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
      <li>website hosting: Scaleway, France;</li>
      <li>sending login emails: MailGun, Europe.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="leading-relaxed mt-4">
      Your data is hosted in the European Union. Our email delivery provider, Mailgun
      (Mailgun Technologies, Inc., part of the Sinch group), processes emails in its EU region. However,
      certain technical support operations may involve access from the United States; such access is
      governed by the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- 5 --%>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">5. Data Location</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed">Your data is hosted in the European Union.</p>
  </div>

  <%!-- 6 --%>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">6. Retention Period</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
      <li>
        Email address: kept as long as your account is active. An account inactive for 3 years is automatically deleted.
      </li>
      <li>Connection data: kept for 1 year.</li>
      <li>If you delete your account, your data is erased within 30 days.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <%!-- 7 --%>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">7. Your Rights</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Under the GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict, object to the processing of,
      and port your data.
    </p>
    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
      To exercise these rights or delete your account, write to <a
        href="mailto:contact@teachercoop.org"
        class="underline"
      >contact@teachercoop.org</a>.
      We respond within one month.
    </p>
    <p class="leading-relaxed">
      If you believe your rights are not being respected, you may file a complaint with the CNIL (the French data protection authority): <a
        href="https://www.cnil.fr"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="underline"
      >www.cnil.fr</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- 8 --%>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">8. Security</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed">
      We protect your data with appropriate measures: encrypted connections (HTTPS), restricted access to data,
      and use of service providers that ensure a level of security compliant with the GDPR.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- 9 --%>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">9. Cookies</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed">
      This site only uses cookies that are strictly necessary for it to work, in particular to keep
      you logged in. These cookies do not require your consent and are not used for any advertising
      or analytics tracking.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- 10 --%>
  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">10. Changes</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed">
      This policy may be updated. In the event of a significant change, you will be notified by email or on the site.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
